  "description": "The new Delta model redefines the concept of exclusivity within ALAN’s new line of handcrafted framesets. Entirely handmade in Italy, the Delta is dedicated to those who refuse to settle for the standard and seek a distinctive bicycle capable of seamlessly blending classic lines with modern innovation into a timeless design. Every single frame is a unique masterpiece, thanks to fully customizable geometries, finishes, and details.\n\nOne soul, endless roads. The Delta frameset is a blank canvas ready to host the perfect build for your needs, whether for pure Road performance or Allroad/Gravel adventures. It fully supports both 1x (single chainring) and 2x (double chainring) drivetrains, with tire clearance accommodating up to 40 mm.\n\nChoosing the Delta means investing in a piece of cycling art that marries tradition with innovation.A lifelong riding companion built to endure, delivering unique style and unmatched reliability.\n\nMasterfully built using tube-to-tube welding, the heart of the Delta is a custom Grade 9 titanium (Ti3Al-2.5V) tubing set. This engineering choice delivers extraordinary structural strength, maximum fatigue resistance, and controlled elasticity. Working in perfect synergy with the carbon fork, the frame naturally absorbs road vibrations, offering unparalleled riding comfort",
